# Scope and authorization

User asked to deploy locally and to re-verify that the fix is appropriate now that
the regression point is known ("로컬배포하고. 코드가 깨진지점을 아니까 이번 수정이
적정하게 이루어졌는지 재확인"). Nightly push was authorized earlier in the same task.
No live session was restarted, no old snapshot was overwritten, no remote host was
touched.

# Release state

Released code commit: 50e7906a1b4e3a104414adbbd40313de560a8c9c (nightly), the item-1
fix that pins the auto-compact trigger to the budget the router forwards.

- Publish workflow 39337367303: completed, success, including Verify published tarball.
- Exact version 0.2.51-nightly.20261019-225158.50e7906; registry gitHead equals the
  released commit; nightly tag points to this version; latest remains 0.2.51.
- dist.shasum ce5e88e4faabf55b699ac7b40269fd19733d716f; dist.integrity
